Optimize Context and its step notes (Memoize Context,
Provider Component, Split Context). This note is about
invocation order: where each update starts, when the provider value
is compared, which fibers get marked by context propagation, and which
components the workshop tests expect to run.

Notation: V1, S2 and so on are distinct object identities. “Bail out”
means React reuses the previous output without calling the component
